Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.29,0:16:29.59,IN-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.15\blur4}我們要去哪
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.59,0:16:31.72,IN-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.15\blur4}去哪裡都行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.93,0:15:25.93,IN-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.15\blur4}眠りから目覚めたら
