Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.49,0:16:10.85,IN-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.15\blur4}世界がほどける音が
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.85,0:16:13.12,IN-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.15\blur4}かけてくる
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:15.46,IN-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.15\blur4}かけてくる
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.46,0:16:17.54,IN-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.15\blur4}朝がくる
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.87,0:16:20.25,IN-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.15\blur4}未来で振り向くあなたに
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.25,0:16:22.53,IN-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.15\blur4}手を振って
